# Voice SaaS V1 — env var NAMES only. Never put a real key in this file
# or commit a real .env file to GitHub.
#
# 1) ElevenLabs (required for real audio; without it the app runs in DEMO
#    mode and /api/tts returns 503 — no fake audio is ever generated).
#    Get it at: elevenlabs.io -> sign up (free, no card) -> Profile -> API Keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# 2) Supabase (V2 wiring; V1 runs on the in-memory DEMO credit ledger).
#    Create a project, run supabase/schema.sql, then set these.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# 3) Admin demo passcode (V1 demo only — change before selling).
#    If unset, the demo passcode is 1234 and the admin pages say so.
ADMIN_PASSCODE=
